cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite the paper below and this repository."
title: "GPR surface & bed picking tool"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based tool for manually picking the glacier surface and bed in
  ground-penetrating radar radargrams, with export in VGG Image Annotator (VIA)
  CSV format. Built for an inter-analyst picking experiment on UAV-borne GPR data.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Siebenbrunner
    given-names: Anna
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2255-2354"
    affiliation: "GEORESEARCH Forschungsgesellschaft mbH; Technical University of Munich"
repository-code: "https://github.com/anna7br/gpr-picking-experiment"
url: "https://anna7br.github.io/gpr-picking-experiment/"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - ground-penetrating radar
  - glaciology
  - ice thickness
  - annotation tool
  - inter-analyst variability
